  "name": "[GitHub] API Health Monitor",
  "description": null,
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "48054d40-8c2a-4a7b-bb05-a5dacbef123e",
      "name": "Sticky Note 79166658",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## API Health Monitor\n\nMonitor a list of HTTP endpoints on a schedule and get a Slack alert whenever one goes down.\n\n### How it works\n1. The workflow runs every hour\n2. The Code node defines your list of endpoints to check\n3. Each endpoint receives a GET request\n4. If a request fails (connection refused, DNS error, timeout), a Slack alert fires\n5. Healthy endpoints produce no output\n\n### Setup\n1. Edit the \"Define Endpoints to Monitor\" node: replace the placeholder names and URLs with your real endpoints\n2. Connect your Slack Bot credential\n3. Set your Slack channel ID in \"Send Down Alert\"\n4. Activate the workflow\n\n### Customization\nChange the schedule in \"Run Health Checks Hourly\" \u2014 every 5 minutes, every 15 minutes, or daily. Add POST endpoints by changing the method in \"Check Endpoint\" and providing a body.",
        "color": 1,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "614bedf1-abaf-4033-81fa-09dd4dcd0b19",
      "name": "Sticky Note 433d7170",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -50,
        -50
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check Endpoints\nRuns a GET request for each URL. If the request fails, the item passes to the alert branch.",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "62db5dcd-1a1c-4e3e-ae50-0c348c8073ce",
      "name": "Run Health Checks Hourly",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "030cb583-23ae-406b-a424-de1e13ce0b98",
      "name": "Define Endpoints to Monitor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        224,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "return [\n  { json: { name: \"YOUR_SERVICE_1\", url: \"YOUR_SERVICE_1_URL\" } },\n  { json: { name: \"YOUR_SERVICE_2\", url: \"YOUR_SERVICE_2_URL\" } },\n  { json: { name: \"YOUR_SERVICE_3\", url: \"YOUR_SERVICE_3_URL\" } }\n];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "973257b8-419d-44a4-907d-ff350c967b40",
      "name": "Check Endpoint",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "redirect": {
            "redirect": {
              "followRedirects": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "29e0117e-12f2-4cdb-8f83-abe5f3330850",
      "name": "Is Endpoint Down?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        672,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.error ? \"down\" : \"up\" }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "rightValue": "down"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1ba1cb4-799a-4ba8-8f8d-43449896cfda",
      "name": "Send Down Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        896,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID"
        },
        "text": "=:red_circle: *Health Alert*\n*{{ $json.name }}* is not responding\nURL: {{ $json.url }}\nError: {{ $json.error?.message ?? \"Connection failed\" }}\nTime: {{ $now.toISO() }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "3ed190e2-0d1f-4d56-ad44-9549bbbccbe1"
    }
  ],
